## Summary

This is a **Next.js 16 (canary) Pages Router** blog application with:

| Category | Details |
|----------|---------|
| **Routing** | Pages Router (`pages/`) -- no `app/` directory |
| **Pages** | Home (`/`), Blog listing (`/blog`), Blog detail (`/blog/[id]`), 404, Error |
| **API Routes** | `/api/posts` (GET/POST) and `/api/posts/[id]` (GET/PUT/DELETE) |
| **Data Fetching** | `getServerSideProps` (home), `getStaticProps` + `getStaticPaths` (blog), ISR with revalidation |
| **Custom document** | `_document.js` -- Inter font, favicon, lang="en" |
| **Custom app** | `_app.js` -- AppProvider context wrapper, shared header/nav/footer |
| **Custom error** | `_error.js` -- with `getInitialProps` |
| **Components** | 1 custom component: `AppProvider.js` (React context for theme) |
| **Hooks** | 1 custom hook: `useAppContext` (consumes theme context) |
| **Styles** | Single `globals.css` with CSS class-based styling |
| **Types/Interfaces** | None defined in project (only implicit JS types) |
| **Middleware** | None |
| **Dependencies** | Next.js 16 canary, React 19.1, `ai` SDK, `@ai-sdk/react`, `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, `zod` v4 |
| **Dev tools** | TypeScript 5, Vitest, Vite |

